  "structure": {
    "block_count": 110,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "25 Gorgeous Baby Shower Cake Ideas to Sweeten Your Party",
        "text_sha256": "567e51fca7fbb3dc64ce57ef5a607eaa19157a5e72ab9655aa8951ee2413ec89",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Minor copy and formatting changes.",
        "text_sha256": "7d2988377f53d02f7193cf6ab583f88affc395511d89bb136bcb32b1b81e3b97",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Baby shower cakes",
        "text_sha256": "ba417749c4a11b5ea4f75be971e22883382d3c37e682de69044a10d43ee58e63",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "These creative baby shower cakes set the stage for a lovely celebration.",
        "text_sha256": "c4359e088ac9a898c0b511cb542432615d6e252b8d775d0f3d99de518401e3a4",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "There are lots of moving parts when planning a baby shower. The baby shower invitations , party theme and guest list all play a role in setting the tone for the event. But no celebration would be complete without sweet treats — specifically, a gorgeous cake.",
        "text_sha256": "5cc30e376e6fc1a69aaa5c946c25ca34fe2e722d5d54f57f5e98cf89f32ff2fe",
        "word_count": 46
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A baby shower cake can act as a visual centerpiece during the celebration, and it's a great opportunity to mirror the baby shower theme , decor and any other elements that are woven throughout the special day. Thankfully, creativity and cake design go hand-in-hand.",
        "text_sha256": "76a397113e6fc34c71b5300318e2270fa128c1aa747f6a56ab96cc938d5d9b99",
        "word_count": 44
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Need some inspiration? We rounded up 25 baby shower cake ideas for a festive, sweet fix guests (and the parents-to-be!) will love.",
        "text_sha256": "c4fa838d861d5651c5bfcef1bd71b3731f39e487f932b5460f57a92c3d063c83",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Simple baby shower cakes",
        "text_sha256": "7fa250727c046ea715016aa355fef5f42b4f89226c9f2469343e440e9ce28533",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Elephant baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "57a521d0d17d9bec7ddb72c9ab7a30891bdcb8c43982ffc6624c0727ae22841e",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "elephant baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "2c59ea7c4442644570eeab9d9350f7e078bd04afe9d2affa157b9b133bde91fa",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Elephants frequently feature as a baby shower party theme — and a nursery motif, too! A classic blue elephant cake is a charming option.",
        "text_sha256": "bdb7169b64133b93710327b4fc3aa41da35b6e4ce816e2df128672916f66f2b1",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Under the sea baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "8b2e162a3b0ff521494ba6b41a569e7213f4b5be22ce4878dba2793154e854f6",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "under the sea baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "7ff272a3de589d60ca96a00c308b4ee6a5df1f523856637c7096489545586620",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This gorgeous cake is understated but beachy. And what expectant mama wouldn't love feeling like she's on a mini vacation during her baby shower?",
        "text_sha256": "3f16235802ee6b0db67f7584d914605be4d8a957cd3cfaa043d8848e20b3252c",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Mom-to-be baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "12962508c6fb55bc578d5389582132b0ccdacead516e0669fd2c6129b8c6a912",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "celebrating the mom-to-be baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "a0358ac0f8259940d768a80ae7a21b8087dfa9dfcc314b3459dc4337469ed0be",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Everyone's gathered to help welcome the baby, of course, but this gorgeous cake is a sweet way to put the mom-to-be front and center.",
        "text_sha256": "b5acea99176c998dbf20cb40f033119d08fdc52e3249c5c1d6c45d85c7384aeb",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Halloween baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "70fa322d91211647bf08a3980e546b80fe8ac7288ad39ffeb2d6d2d7889ea772",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "fall baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "c592f6f18e294f9a01374a2d97a9eb2b1847b3af96a6ef3952f569cb0f3c060e",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you're having a fall baby shower , embrace the autumnal vibes by including some seasonal accents on your cake. Fondant pumpkins and a few simple leaves do the trick.",
        "text_sha256": "762797a3231c87e10726be84eb2b96fca0b9407f7e504fad18e800ae0152b0dc",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Baby shower cake toppers",
        "text_sha256": "a288153501c33dde9f48855ace16d2853967c9014789eefea872937d095b358c",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Balloon baby shower cake topper",
        "text_sha256": "8dba83a801115a74a9b2b53f6b8f506ed051b3fdf44bd40175cda33b8c995210",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "balloon baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "b477e7a1eee3a9f140ef1ed659cc780038bb4aa6979cebf5be06789eee16c509",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Decorating a cake with different shades of blue (or any color that matches the shower theme) and big balloon toppers is a simple but playful way to celebrate a new arrival.",
        "text_sha256": "c7efa05689b60585f906b7d2f11e3ea26b19f872ddf8f1c61a008225a5c64ee3",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Floral baby shower cake topper",
        "text_sha256": "a29e41993b8c47b09ec0317e8a0c6551be3e81106f616247e1a9c93edd95433a",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "floral baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "c1b6e59eab6a2f99280452d8e9d5ce7540e1aecd5ed8342d777fa7766f966d1d",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "For the parents-to-be who love elegant flowers, consider incorporating fresh blooms as a delicate cake topper.",
        "text_sha256": "2c30c8bd645db020b7a396c6af978b19e52744186c1fc83039a8b4e8ff3b0979",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Baby carriage cake topper",
        "text_sha256": "72f9f1418651e1b690d6ca07b380c371823a2169f38c4713961b18acfb8be50a",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "baby carriage baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "298af1b32737c0edca1815254b09f69dc1d1a536c55a9fdf0f0c8854ef543f97",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This joyful pink cake topper — and delightful oversized bow — makes it clear that the baby on the way is already so loved.",
        "text_sha256": "522224862b4a0260a54cbc472d611e254849dba6fdd807e803521ec9bd0422cc",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Baby shower cakes for girls",
        "text_sha256": "7a276e798848b1017087af32155d5f8e3acedfc95418c19b298278fc1e8d29d4",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Pink baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "2f9868d6d8efca3fa422c2ac099a596619668da56dea4fadd8287281ff6142a2",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "winter baby shower pink cake",
        "text_sha256": "70e5931bd72c1728cfc522dac0f47fa0058df625d3985ddfe33a206e72a01226",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Hot pink makes this festive baby shower cake pop. Serve it up alongside a batch of colorful baby shower punch , and guests won't miss the buffet table.",
        "text_sha256": "50e651b1702f0175aadc132c7a0b17c979902c8227fd473a6a7cb105b7d95632",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Stork delivery baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "b218b9f1d52277051604dc86f16347694d707b48e64caca1ebbb3996417874cd",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "stork delivery baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "3c7fc8c99ea456368b99201e837f031393e80461fe94efcbc84d8fb574955643",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Look what the stork's delivering! Soft pink hues and stork details are a lovely way to celebrate a baby on the way.",
        "text_sha256": "2f9213cfecd44876603ea5ca2e97b5177f77b962ddbff2109ec4cab4960f5e91",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Princess baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "8c90ff836835bb258aef5361d3f22e100265bd138c6d7af5af764adeb6a95feb",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "pink princess baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "59697750326594a4d64617491e8b786c89be3f2895700222d8df7bae80dac0c3",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Embrace all things pink and princess-themed with a crown-topped baby shower cake fit for royalty.",
        "text_sha256": "c6fdd9841b4781c98d5852fe9d7e736be1e6ca5f6780c4ce8ab2b3dde8b362f4",
        "word_count": 15
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Baby shower cakes for boys",
        "text_sha256": "10b8ee009366ec2e131a01f4d41199db984c26acd36a26fe63a757e7e04ab73c",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Outer space baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "6e6f65e65a0cb630a77da8621893553b92f9ff386f926147dec60f3a0d929a55",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "outer space baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "b5b0288fddd1c7f15bc7969bd6e31325295746e32b20b7cc5f950ada1461b626",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000043",
        "block_index": 43,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Infuse the dessert table with some flair from the Milky Way — or a galaxy far, far away.",
        "text_sha256": "d7cec17cfce43af1a0938d49fa1573c8e1d80debd084756e383149b9ff723086",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000044",
        "block_index": 44,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Woodland baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "d6ee0007af9f7d6b6dc6b55e92821e2f6b73e08395ce4a736da662021bb57e9e",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000045",
        "block_index": 45,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "winter woodland baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "9bae9a3834c03456493d2054bcbfcabf090ff593d4d9c651bace18db65041517",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000046",
        "block_index": 46,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Chocolate \"bark\" makes this cake blend right in with other forest decor, like pincecones, bottle brush trees and a wooden stag.",
        "text_sha256": "6f3f22118e2afc90467186fe9cc27250fe86b7b0686a4ab634c30ad29eb08a14",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000047",
        "block_index": 47,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Blue baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "f53d11507fa5e14eb5b75c55f03b5e20723b45d8b753f8f79e9c67d7e8a43431",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000048",
        "block_index": 48,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pastels are lovely, but a bold splash of color — like this vibrant navy cake with gold speckles — can really grab attention and double as a stunning baby shower centerpiece.",
        "text_sha256": "6bbb7cf7e6637c66c7edb82cc795a9fe574e978056e2869aad3f6b0ec833d630",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000049",
        "block_index": 49,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "More baby shower cake ideas",
        "text_sha256": "e64f6c78febaa6cef6868ef568cbdff60c97055efb56c5e22a4366143e8605a9",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000050",
        "block_index": 50,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Winter baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "d58386159c244d7a015f68178aaffbbc1949349e13c7effc948a03d072752223",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000051",
        "block_index": 51,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "all white winter baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "a5940e8e995ec6385a8e7721b56542ab2b1d1cd85fe866170763d93a5513e871",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000052",
        "block_index": 52,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A all-white cake can welcome a winter baby in style. Mittens, snowflakes and polar bears make for sweet seasonal accents.",
        "text_sha256": "f3c25c0e73a528392b9fb9f516c46c4d4a6c12877c6cfe4ff2dfdf6f5916ca04",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000053",
        "block_index": 53,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Stars and moon baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "8845741d1044f4fd4b4c653ac24d18f625030e5fa13fa849e28db1c1cb9ef7a0",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000054",
        "block_index": 54,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "stars and moon baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "a76bf496c934afe383f51cee0bc194535545a4bcfd8501c4a0ca71c6557bd9db",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000055",
        "block_index": 55,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A crescent moon, golden stars and puffy clouds festoon this sky-themed cake. It's perfect for the parents-to-be already imagining endless readings of Goodnight Moon !",
        "text_sha256": "1c98e9e52ad760baa8cd69716e70ea173d58aebf6c33fa7b034c5417460b3786",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000056",
        "block_index": 56,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Twins baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "6b28ca46ea1bace976ec353b82edf1849ae2959c22a2e93af6ffec49f9fe9eca",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000057",
        "block_index": 57,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "twin baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "f9c56d46c419a33587c96cebf0af8b38661ef2cf313a9503701ba74e7dcfda98",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000058",
        "block_index": 58,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Double the babies, double the cake! For parents who are joyfully anticipating twins , a double cake is the perfect sweet treat.",
        "text_sha256": "f054688e291987f0a7e643becad9154cc2735d832b813e7c99d29f8d6a440443",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000059",
        "block_index": 59,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Twinkle, twinkle baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "019d2a0a1da8c16d2bcbdab9cab6f57aac7207480f5da76a8aefa7192fa6a98f",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000060",
        "block_index": 60,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "twinkle, twinkle baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "8c13c17f0d700bbf9b992f2bf964fd6f9b55277448e0a20257f9e8f6f9e84ee6",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000061",
        "block_index": 61,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A sweet \"Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star\" theme is always in style. This one doubles as a gender reveal !",
        "text_sha256": "ffb3b7644375e59953cd76e97354057fd18727b3ca9a8badf9a9d6c335aaa99c",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000062",
        "block_index": 62,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Giraffe baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "df1764b267dfcf943280bf6f3f3ff12cb149cb936b88e6d9bac81da13a3a036b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000063",
        "block_index": 63,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "giraffe baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "9ca3bf30a9888388c2cb6c6b660cb3a491c678b048cc4e8a73222d3b494185cf",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000064",
        "block_index": 64,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Elephants may be one of the most popular animals when it comes to nursery decor and baby shower themes, but giraffes are up there, too! (Just think of the many beloved Sophie teething toys out there.)",
        "text_sha256": "942f2097044369f8932cabeae151d565772c17dfb7e772a9dd9c90d261321b5a",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000065",
        "block_index": 65,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Floral baby shower cupcakes",
        "text_sha256": "619183a3dfc96b998f55274cd2801709407a964d5f697488077ce92e671b2414",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000066",
        "block_index": 66,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "floral baby shower cupcakes",
        "text_sha256": "c69f5b1cd91e0500ec3813414a5bff6e2a2d23f396c2b47ed03225fe8cb2d5e6",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000067",
        "block_index": 67,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Who says you have to have a cake? For the floral-loving mama-to-be, you might serve up these charming baby shower cupcakes decorated with breathtaking, elaborate blooms.",
        "text_sha256": "524e86c0b7b988d902d82de7ffc6047362c9b71b7266a02487481f5ade44e886",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000068",
        "block_index": 68,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Bear baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "81366df23d8403873378674e8a049c3c19238757e1bb7fbdf3033cb77a18088e",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000069",
        "block_index": 69,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "bear baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "42ae48bf6bd337150e52150b22b6abad06065704ec0d3dec89b83b0db9ce7c9c",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000070",
        "block_index": 70,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Let your imagination go wild when it comes to picking out a baby shower cake! This impressive cake features a cuddly teddy bear in a chocolate hot air balloon.",
        "text_sha256": "ad1794aa2133588ddef0c68c699d3cd4cbfb8dc3626988c11ddbabdc4503eb9d",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000071",
        "block_index": 71,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Nautical baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "e40f8dfccbd17a492728c11e70872b2f379c75ae75a5426f41e9cdfd11a38acf",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000072",
        "block_index": 72,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "nautical baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "594fcb7337cd2fc0c15274a5814665d72ec17ba13af27274da5ff5e65bd0f1dc",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000073",
        "block_index": 73,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Whether the expectant parents are welcoming their little one in the summer or just love sailing, a nautical cake is a sweet bet.",
        "text_sha256": "f9680f13fb21211db90b439a70a19e3257c03697ac6769f553193a47eea10638",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000074",
        "block_index": 74,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Mickey Mouse baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "538058b53beba704c6d4dbacdc20f471ee9a0453ae058f17eb745c9aab12b0b0",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000075",
        "block_index": 75,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "mickey mouse baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "89488bac20d24be48828ace3847d1ff16f504cf66944c77a217996bb2338b06e",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000076",
        "block_index": 76,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "This two-tier cake is a simple but striking way to celebrate a Disney lover.",
        "text_sha256": "dbcabe8fda2476f75d30cc4032527aa595947e97dd2d770eb5c2614c33d1af6b",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000077",
        "block_index": 77,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Dr. Seuss baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "b32d3084282060311d381a98a3af5ee6df8d249decac5df27c3769a47f859683",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000078",
        "block_index": 78,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "dr seuss baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "812d6cad186968a6732b7c7ddc487f731f32708f823052f169c4897d84dca42c",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000079",
        "block_index": 79,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Beloved Dr. Seuss characters (especially \"New Fish\" in the stroller!) add eye-catching detail to a baby shower cake that's cleverly designed to resemble The Cat in the Hat's famous accessory.",
        "text_sha256": "cae672e78fd473e3b40e496fefc2b41c37be7d66f4b95bea057e33316d036019",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000080",
        "block_index": 80,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Birch log baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "edd6a0bd1c9225ee03621fb9c88f218b3cdb87ab02209d01c1b73b39ae3988f6",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000081",
        "block_index": 81,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "woodland baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "db1d2801ed0aa1c464d1e6c37e7d5421f3da62790e37efaff59cc6ebcd216fec",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000082",
        "block_index": 82,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Sweet animals, mushrooms, shrubs and trees adorn this whimsical, woodland-themed cake that would be perfect for a winter wonderland baby shower .",
        "text_sha256": "8f973bd41f2ec0ea5346d36839237ee16365bd382d9a7315d0fbae13c9b9a31e",
        "word_count": 22
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000083",
        "block_index": 83,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Bunny baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "84afb5e9aa70d112758653998fa11771dbbfd38a19eb67d1a33dfc5061213549",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000084",
        "block_index": 84,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "blue bunny baby shower cake",
        "text_sha256": "429a2d438c6faf0cde121262b6c1d9d639892f6fb1d83502ce4dfb08037c6114",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000085",
        "block_index": 85,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Oh, bunny! Celebrate a little bunny on the way with this Peter Rabbit-themed baby shower cake, complete with carrots and a frosting picket fence.",
        "text_sha256": "077169878f185f2aebef08517d09c3e2418684ebf0442cc2f4aa34890fcf4cef",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000086",
        "block_index": 86,
        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "What to Expect When You're Expecting , 5th edition, Heidi Murkoff. WhatToExpect.com, How to Plan a Baby Shower , December 2023. WhatToExpect.com, 35 Creative Baby Shower Themes , August 2021. WhatToExpect.com, A Complete Guide to Baby Shower Etiquette , November 2023.",
        "text_sha256": "a08aa8003dc17ef51c9f8e7cf888abe6c31f3d47ab596570ad772055a3fd704b",
        "word_count": 41
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000087",
        "block_index": 87,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Updates history",
        "text_sha256": "8ce5f24a37ab68e01743f0cb3f0234dd767a31a441e3e3be35047619722ffec6",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000088",
        "block_index": 88,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "December 6, 2023",
        "text_sha256": "a43756c7d753549a1661f3bf8ab9736077eeabb4b7ac362a4fe4df7922d78a72",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
